    {
      "id": "claim_3cf04e6b42724da89d4b003b4c0508ff",
      "statement": "For sustained 429s or jev circuit-breaker trips, the sanctioned fix is lowering myfeeder.interest.sweep-batch-size and/or lengthening myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay in application.yaml; an out-of-band emergency lever `kubectl -n myfeeder set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE=20` restarts the pod with a lower batch size immediately, but must be removed with `kubectl -n myfeeder set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE-` once the equivalent value is committed to application.yaml and deployed, because a Helm upgrade's three-way merge can otherwise leave the out-of-band env var in place.",
